       IT fixture for MigrationFindingsIT, NOT part of the demo seed set).
       The RENAME variant of the lossy collapse, with THREE concurrent tokens: `scopeR` holds a
       three-way parallel fork. v2 is byte-for-byte the same model except the subprocess id is
       `scopeS` — indistinguishable from a removal to both the engine and the pre-check, and
       equally lossy (three tokens in, one out). -->
